      "source_id": "CHAT-065",
      "origin_type": "conversation",
      "category": "planetary",
      "statement": "アミノ酸や有機物を天体環境へ投入し、分解・希薄化・重合・生命前段階を観察できる。"
    },
    {
      "source_key": "A05",
      "source_id": "CHAT-066",
      "origin_type": "conversation",
